OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,6,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain,
OL,7,Flargely light at first but becoming
OL,8,Fheavier and more persistent through
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Some drier spells of
OL,10,Fweather across Shetland in the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay cloudy through
OL,13,Fthe evening and overnight with showery
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes. Freshening northeasterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FIt will remain cloudy
OL,18,Fthroughout the day with outbreaks of
OL,19,Foccasionally heavy rain, and fresh
OL,20,Fnortheast to northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
